{"id":"4a9c89b3e42d1880","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-term-graph-homomorphism.md","title":"项图同态与同构","display":"df-term-graph-homomorphism — 项图同态与同构","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism","aliases":["56-df-term-graph-homomorphism"],"display":"df-term-graph-homomorphism — 项图同态与同构","depends_on":["[[56-df-term-graph]]"],"source_section":"§13.2 Definition 13.2.2","source_printed_pages":"715","source_ocr_blocks":[736],"source_verification":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-term-graph-homomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-graph-homomorphism — 项图同态与同构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2 Definition 13.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"715"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>736</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\">\\(G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)\">\\(H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TermGraph}\">\\(\\operatorname{TermGraph}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in N_G\">\\(n\\in N_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in N_H\">\\(m\\in N_H\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\in N_H^{N_G}\">\\(\\phi\\in N_H^{N_G}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span> 是函数图的定义域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,m)\\iff{}&amp;\n(n\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\lambda_G)\\land\nm\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\lambda_H))\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n((n,f)\\in\\lambda_G\\land(m,f)\\in\\lambda_H).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,m)\\iff{}&amp;\n(n\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\lambda_G)\\land\nm\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\lambda_H))\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n((n,f)\\in\\lambda_G\\land(m,f)\\in\\lambda_H).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphHom}_\\Sigma(G,H,\\phi)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\phi\\in N_H^{N_G}\\land\\phi(r_G)=r_H\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in N_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,\\phi(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\land |a_G(n)|=|a_H(\\phi(n))|\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|a_G(n)|\\}\\cap\\{1,\\ldots,|a_H(\\phi(n))|\\}\\;\n\\phi(a_G(n)_i)=a_H(\\phi(n))_i\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphHom}_\\Sigma(G,H,\\phi)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\phi\\in N_H^{N_G}\\land\\phi(r_G)=r_H\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in N_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,\\phi(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\land |a_G(n)|=|a_H(\\phi(n))|\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|a_G(n)|\\}\\cap\\{1,\\ldots,|a_H(\\phi(n))|\\}\\;\n\\phi(a_G(n)_i)=a_H(\\phi(n))_i\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphIso}_\\Sigma(G,H)\\iff\n\\exists\\phi\\in N_H^{N_G}\\;\\bigl(&amp;\\operatorname{GraphHom}_\\Sigma(G,H,\\phi)\n\\land\\phi[N_G]=N_H\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,n&#39;\\in N_G\\;(\\phi(n)=\\phi(n&#39;)\\Rightarrow n=n&#39;)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphIso}_\\Sigma(G,H)\\iff\n\\exists\\phi\\in N_H^{N_G}\\;\\bigl(&amp;\\operatorname{GraphHom}_\\Sigma(G,H,\\phi)\n\\land\\phi[N_G]=N_H\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,n&#39;\\in N_G\\;(\\phi(n)=\\phi(n&#39;)\\Rightarrow n=n&#39;)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>GraphLabelEq准确展开原书的部分（Kleene）相等：双方都未定义，或者双方定义且标签相同。仅要求已标号一方的标签被保存会错误地允许把开放叶节点映到常元节点；这里不允许该情形。参数长度等式由标签条件和项图公理亦可推出，显式保留以确定每个坐标的定义域。</p>\n<p>同态在整个源节点集上定义，但不要求满射；基础项图容许不可达节点，所以这里不声称根保持自动使同态满射。同构为双射同态；逆映射保持标签和有序参数，理由是每个目标节点有唯一原像。不在本簇建立同态关系的商偏序。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的本地 Terese (2003) DjVu；OCR页块序号为提取文本块标识，不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$；$G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)$、$H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)$ 满足 [[56-df-term-graph]] 的 $\\operatorname{TermGraph}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)","display":false},{"tex":"H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TermGraph}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in N_G","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in N_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi\\in N_H^{N_G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,m)\\iff{}&\n(n\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\lambda_G)\\land\nm\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\lambda_H))\\\\\n&\\lor\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n((n,f)\\in\\lambda_G\\land(m,f)\\in\\lambda_H).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphHom}_\\Sigma(G,H,\\phi)\\iff{}&\n\\phi\\in N_H^{N_G}\\land\\phi(r_G)=r_H\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in N_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,\\phi(n))\\\\\n&\\hspace{12mm}\\land |a_G(n)|=|a_H(\\phi(n))|\\\\\n&\\hspace{12mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|a_G(n)|\\}\\cap\\{1,\\ldots,|a_H(\\phi(n))|\\}\\;\n\\phi(a_G(n)_i)=a_H(\\phi(n))_i\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GraphIso}_\\Sigma(G,H)\\iff\n\\exists\\phi\\in N_H^{N_G}\\;\\bigl(&\\operatorname{GraphHom}_\\Sigma(G,H,\\phi)\n\\land\\phi[N_G]=N_H\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n,n'\\in N_G\\;(\\phi(n)=\\phi(n')\\Rightarrow n=n')\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2486,"backlinks":[{"id":"9a89c52b489c33b7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"标签部分相等谓词 $\\operatorname{GraphLabelEq}_\\Sigma(G,n,H,m)$ 见 [[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]。"},{"id":"ec93c08d698f2539","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-347","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism.md]]"},{"id":"faf9dd8d1400edec","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"访问路径、展开、互模拟及同构谓词见 [[56-df-graph-access-path]]、[[56-df-graph-unravelling]]、[[56-df-graph-bisimulation]]、[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]。"},{"id":"e42d17d6f02097e2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Acc}_G$ 与 $\\operatorname{end}_G$ 见 [[56-df-graph-access-path]]；$\\mathsf U_\\Sigma$ 见 [[56-df-graph-unravelling]]；同态谓词见 [[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]。"}],"outgoing":["904f367f2b11cda0"]}